<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - ING maintains buy order on Akzo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - ING maintains buy order on Akzo.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 25 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Akzo Nobel	chemicals     198.00  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (reiterated). Akzo's new anti-depressant Remeron turned out to be more effective than Eli Lilly's Prozac, the world leading anti-depressant. Remeron should contribute positively to Akzo's earnings. Akzo's Pharma Division has a promising portfolio and with the pill scare dissipating, the underlying volume growth should return to 6 percent or more.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	18.46		 10.8    7.00</p>
<p>    1996		   19.00		 10.7    7.00</p>
<p>    1997		   20.50		  9.9    8.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
